    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Phil,<div><br></div><div>when i fit a mixedmirt model i have problems obtaining the iteminformation:</div><div><br></div><div><div>mod &lt;- mixedmirt(Science, covdat, model=1, fixed = ~ 0 + group) #example from documentation</div><div>Theta = matrix(seq(-4,4,.1))</div><div>iteminfo(extract.item(mod, 1), Theta = Theta)</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I get an error </div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;font-size:12px;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,43,54)\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(147,161,161);padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;border-style:none;outline:none;word-wrap:break-word;width:968px;font-family:inherit!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;font-stretch:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(181,137,0)\">\r\n  Theta does not have the correct number of dimensions\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">but</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> reading from source code, this statement should be FALSE and the function should run:</span></font></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre\"><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:12.7272720336914px;line-height:16.5454540252686px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;overflow:visible\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">if</span>(ncol(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Theta</span>) <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">!=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">x</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">@</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">nfact</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);vertical-align:top;text-align:right;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"><br></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;overflow:visible\">stop(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(223,80,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>Theta does not have the correct number of dimensions<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>)</td></tr></tbody></table></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0)\">&gt; m</span><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);font-size:10.4pt;line-height:1.2;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit\">od@nfact</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">[1] 1\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0)\">ncol(Theta)\r\n</span>[1] 1\r\n</pre></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\">\r\n<font color=\"#000000\">Best wishes! Felix</font></td></tr></tbody></table></span></div>"
