  {
   "id": "DxWe2GD0J84J",
   "from": "Phil Chalmers",
   "author": "b330c2028fed415b",
   "date": "2015-02-04T16:04:44Z",
   "subject": "Re: iteminfo in mixedmirt fails",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Felix,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for the report, this is definitely a bug that should have been stopped. mixedmirt() objects don&#39;t really have a well defined information function in that each individual could have their own fixed/random intercept term. So the above model actually contains intercepts that are conditional on group, because logit(P) ~ aθ + d + beta * X, where X is the indicator variable for group. The problem gets even more complicated when beta is a random effect for groups, in which case information become much harder to define. Cheers.</div><div><br></div><div>Phil</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Feb 4, 2015 at 9:16 AM, Dr. Hans Hansen <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bea...@gmx.de</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Phil,<div><br></div><div>when i fit a mixedmirt model i have problems obtaining the iteminformation:</div><div><br></div><div><div>mod &lt;- mixedmirt(Science, covdat, model=1, fixed = ~ 0 + group) #example from documentation</div><div>Theta = matrix(seq(-4,4,.1))</div><div>iteminfo(extract.item(mod, 1), Theta = Theta)</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I get an error </div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;font-size:12px;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,43,54)\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(147,161,161);padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;border-style:none;outline:none;word-wrap:break-word;width:968px;font-family:inherit!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;font-stretch:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(181,137,0)\">\r\n  Theta does not have the correct number of dimensions\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">but</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> reading from source code, this statement should be FALSE and the function should run:</span></font></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(133,153,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:12.7272720336914px;line-height:16.5454540252686px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible\"><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">if</span>(ncol(<span>Theta</span>) <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">!=</span> <span>x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">@</span><span>nfact</span>)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);vertical-align:top;text-align:right;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"><br></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible\">stop(<span style=\"color:rgb(223,80,0)\"><span>&#39;</span>Theta does not have the correct number of dimensions<span>&#39;</span></span>)</td></tr></tbody></table></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!imp