   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">For Rasch models, this is a good reference using R: <a href=\"http://www.jstatsoft.org/v39/i12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.jstatsoft.org/v39/i12&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475937950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zYlddaDtsEA1iuZeQUm6X\">http://www.jstatsoft.org/v39/i12</a>. Gets the concept across, and once that is mastered what mixedmirt is doing is simply an extension of this method for more complicated/flexible IRT models. <div><br></div><div>Phil</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
